---
// The contour field behind the hero - the original landing page's own
// artwork, carried over path for path. WEBSITE.md §3 named the topo lines,
// the blaze and the ridge as "the best things on the page"; the redesign
// keeps them and gives them room. Painted in the palette's own moss - a
// deliberate artwork exception to site.css's aliases-only rule, because the
// drawing is pigment, not chrome, and moss at this opacity sits well on the
// paper and the ink grounds alike.
---

